1
00:00:00,099 --> 00:00:03,830
易考范文二十九

2
00:00:03,839 --> 00:00:09,360
The above drawings vividly reflect celebrations

3
00:00:09,369 --> 00:00:13,620
of the Spring Festival. Compared with putting up couplets,

4
00:00:13,629 --> 00:00:17,510
making dumplings and children receiving money from elders,

5
00:00:17,519 --> 00:00:20,520
the traditional customs that have been observed

6
00:00:20,529 --> 00:00:22,040
for thousands of years,

7
00:00:22,049 --> 00:00:25,140
watching the Spring Festival Gala is a novelty,

8
00:00:25,149 --> 00:00:29,280
which has been incorporated into the joyful atmosphere.

9
00:00:29,289 --> 00:00:32,440
It seems to me that the message the painter

10
00:00:32,449 --> 00:00:35,270
intends to convey is not limited to

11
00:00:35,279 --> 00:00:37,320
the Spring Festival celebration;

12
00:00:37,329 --> 00:00:41,060
it is  also about inheritance and innovation of

13
00:00:41,069 --> 00:00:44,050
our fine traditional culture, to be exact.

14
00:00:44,059 --> 00:00:47,740
It is essential that we hold a dialectical attitude

15
00:00:47,749 --> 00:00:50,010
toward the issue. For one thing,

16
00:00:50,019 --> 00:00:53,020
abandoning the heritage left by our ancestors,

17
00:00:53,029 --> 00:00:56,370
if we will fail to keep a foothold as a nation

18
00:00:56,379 --> 00:00:59,620
with unique characteristics. For another,

19
00:00:59,629 --> 00:01:02,550
maintaining tradition doesn't necessarily mean

20
00:01:02,559 --> 00:01:06,040
we hang on to the rules handed down from distant ages.

21
00:01:06,049 --> 00:01:09,300
In an era of intensified globalization,

22
00:01:09,309 --> 00:01:13,150
can China, the nation of the largest population

23
00:01:13,159 --> 00:01:15,700
and the third vastest land in the world,

24
00:01:15,709 --> 00:01:18,780
isolate herself from other parts of the earth?

25
00:01:18,789 --> 00:01:23,490
Absolutely not. Take traditional Chinese medicine for example.

26
00:01:23,499 --> 00:01:27,010
The ancient field could hardly assumed new charm

27
00:01:27,019 --> 00:01:29,440
if it had been for doctors' endeavor

28
00:01:29,449 --> 00:01:31,970
to integrate Western medicine with it.

29
00:01:31,979 --> 00:01:36,020
Generally speaking, only if we combine the preservation

30
00:01:36,029 --> 00:01:38,810
and the development of our fine traditional culture,

31
00:01:38,819 --> 00:01:40,810
can we keep abreast with the times in an all-around way.

